# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 8 STYLE
sw_ = lambda c,n,h: f'<div class="tok" style="background:{c};{"color:#111" if n in ("Paper","Surface") else ""}"><b>{n}</b>{h}</div>'
style = f"""<div class="col" style="gap:18px;color:#1c1c1e"><h3 style="font-size:16px;color:#333">Style guide: calm glass</h3>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;width:1100px">
{sw_("#f4f3f0","Paper","#f4f3f0 light background")}{sw_("#ffffff","Surface","#ffffff cards, 66% glass")}{sw_("#1c1c1e","Ink","#1c1c1e text")}{sw_("#8a8a8e","Muted","#8a8a8e secondary text")}{sw_("#3552d9","Accent","#3552d9 (dark: #8ea6ff)")}{sw_("#34c759","Go","#34c759 on, found, done")}{sw_("#f5a524","Check","#f5a524 look at this")}{sw_("#ff3b30","Delete","#ff3b30 only for delete")}{sw_("#101113","Night","#101113 dark background")}
</div>
<div style="width:1100px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1c1c1e">
<div><b>Type</b><br>System font (SF on Apple, Roboto on Android). Large title 30/700 · title 17/700 · body 15/400 · row title 15/600 · caption 12.5/400 muted. One weight for titles, one for body.</div>
<div><b>Shape</b><br>Cards 14 · sheets 30 · buttons and bars fully round · page thumbnails 5–12 with a thin outline and soft shadow. One radius family everywhere.</div>
<div><b>Spacing</b><br>16 side margin · 12 between cards · rows 10–12 vertical · bottom bar 58 high, floating 14 from the edges. Few words, lots of air.</div>
<div><b>Glass rules</b><br>Only bars, sheets and the cards over the soft background are frosted (blur 18–30, saturate 170%, 1px light edge). Page thumbnails are always solid paper. With "reduce transparency" or on slow phones: solid surfaces, same layout.</div>
<div><b>Colour rules</b><br>One accent for anything tappable. Green = on / found / done. Amber = check this. Red = delete only. Never colour alone: every state has words or an icon.</div>
<div><b>Motion</b><br>Sheets slide up 250 ms; page added: a short highlight; the Scan button gives a light haptic where the browser allows. No bouncing or looping animation. Respect "reduce motion".</div>
<div><b>Icons</b><br>Material Symbols Rounded, inline SVG, 21–24 px, always with a label in bars and menus. The Scan button is icon-only: it is the one thing everyone knows.</div>
<div><b>Layout</b><br>Phone: floating glass bar with 3 tabs (PDFs, Tools, Settings) and a round Scan button. Desktop: sidebar with the same 3 places, Scan in the top right.</div>
<div><b>Accessibility</b><br>Touch targets 44 px or more · text contrast 4.5:1 · every control has a name for screen readers · light and dark follow the phone setting.</div>
</div></div>"""
open('ref-8-style.html','w').write(f'<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Style</title><style>{CSS_ALL}</style><body style="background:#e9e8e4;padding:30px">{style}</body>')
print('ok')
